Rem Records the corrected behaviour (see BUILDING.md): golden from the C++ build
Screen Open 0,640,100,4,Hires : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Ink 1 : Bar 0,0 To 639,9 : Ink 2 : Bar 0,10 To 599,19 : Ink 3 : Plot 600,10 : Ink 1 : Bar 0,20 To 99,29
For I=0 To 15 : Ink I mod 4 : Bar 600+I*2,20 To 601+I*2,29 : Next I
Get Cblock 1,0,0,640,30
Cls 0 : Put Cblock 1,0,40
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/blocks2_1.iff"
Screen Open 1,320,100,2,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Screen 0 : Cls 0 : Ink 1 : Bar 0,0 To 63,7 : Ink 2 : Bar 64,0 To 127,7 : Ink 3 : Bar 0,8 To 127,15
Get Cblock 2,0,0,128,16
Screen 1 : Put Cblock 2,0,0 : Put Cblock 2,0,30
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/blocks2_2.iff"
Ink 1 : Draw 0,60 To 11,60 : Get Bob 1,0,60 To 16,61 : Cls 0 : Paste Bob 10,10,Vrev(1) : Paste Bob 40,10,1
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/blocks2_3.iff"
Print #1,"end"
